{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Deriva</i> is a single-player narrative adventure set in a world flooded after endless rain. You play as Zale, a young boy who inherits his grandfather\u2019s submarine and sets off with his best friend Kiara on a journey across what\u2019s left of civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761930/extras/d94bcca56bbee1baa6a5b1f910e7fb27.poster.avif?t=1750318889\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761930/extras/d94bcca56bbee1baa6a5b1f910e7fb27.webm?t=1750318889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761930/extras/d94bcca56bbee1baa6a5b1f910e7fb27.mp4?t=1750318889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast and melancholic ocean as you navigate between floating islands, visit stilted towns, and dive through forgotten ruins. The gameplay blends fishing, trading, resource management, and freeform exploration in a living world full of small, meaningful moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761930/extras/de2f2939581c458b0574554459175905.poster.avif?t=1750318889\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761930/extras/de2f2939581c458b0574554459175905.webm?t=1750318889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761930/extras/de2f2939581c458b0574554459175905.mp4?t=1750318889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you\u2019ll meet people who have learned to survive among the waves, each with their own stories, ports, and ways of holding on. The story unfolds through the world and your relationships, revealing fragments of the past as you improve your vessel and dive deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761930/extras/77913924ef892119ce602a7e4778f3fe.poster.avif?t=1750318889\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761930/extras/77913924ef892119ce602a7e4778f3fe.webm?t=1750318889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761930/extras/77913924ef892119ce602a7e4778f3fe.mp4?t=1750318889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Deriva</i> combines adventure, visual novel elements, and exploration with a relaxed pace, handcrafted art direction, and a reflective soundtrack. It\u2019s ideal for players looking for a calm, emotional experience focused on atmosphere and personal discovery.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3761930?t=1750318889","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3761930?t=1750318889","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761930/a39a25e3c59455b7320c5d0898809b96927a675f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750318889","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761930/a39a25e3c59455b7320c5d0898809b96927a675f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750318889","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Deriva</i> is a single-player narrative adventure set in a world flooded after endless rain. You play as Zale, a young boy who inherits his grandfather\u2019s submarine and sets off with his best friend Kiara on a journey across what\u2019s left of civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761930/extras/d94bcca56bbee1baa6a5b1f910e7fb27.poster.avif?t=1750318889\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761930/extras/d94bcca56bbee1baa6a5b1f910e7fb27.webm?t=1750318889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761930/extras/d94bcca56bbee1baa6a5b1f910e7fb27.mp4?t=1750318889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast and melancholic ocean as you navigate between floating islands, visit stilted towns, and dive through forgotten ruins. The gameplay blends fishing, trading, resource management, and freeform exploration in a living world full of small, meaningful moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761930/extras/de2f2939581c458b0574554459175905.poster.avif?t=1750318889\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761930/extras/de2f2939581c458b0574554459175905.webm?t=1750318889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761930/extras/de2f2939581c458b0574554459175905.mp4?t=1750318889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you\u2019ll meet people who have learned to survive among the waves, each with their own stories, ports, and ways of holding on. The story unfolds through the world and your relationships, revealing fragments of the past as you improve your vessel and dive deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761930/extras/77913924ef892119ce602a7e4778f3fe.poster.avif?t=1750318889\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761930/extras/77913924ef892119ce602a7e4778f3fe.webm?t=1750318889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761930/extras/77913924ef892119ce602a7e4778f3fe.mp4?t=1750318889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Deriva</i> combines adventure, visual novel elements, and exploration with a relaxed pace, handcrafted art direction, and a reflective soundtrack. It\u2019s ideal for players looking for a calm, emotional experience focused on atmosphere and personal discovery.</p>","developers":["FishEye Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761930/6f48fafba68000be85933874f75504286161fe62/header.jpg?t=1750318889","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3761930/1971690253/87411ff83c8976aa8beec2bfaabbd5ee43f79146/1750377924/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749836188","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3761930/1971690253/87411ff83c8976aa8beec2bfaabbd5ee43f79146/1750377924/dash_h264.mpd?t=1749836188","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3761930/1971690253/87411ff83c8976aa8beec2bfaabbd5ee43f79146/17503